<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomMetadata xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" fqn="CustomDetector__mdt.ARM_037">
    <label>ARM-037</label>
    <protected>false</protected>
    <values><field>DetectorId__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM-037</value></values>
    <values><field>Label__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Active contract past end date</value></values>
    <values><field>Category__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">governance</value></values>
    <values><field>AppliesTo__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">ARM</value></values>
    <values><field>SoqlQuery__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">SELECT Id, ContractNumber, EndDate FROM Contract WHERE Status IN ('Activated','Active') AND EndDate &lt; TODAY</value></values>
    <values><field>TitleTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Contract {ContractNumber} ended {EndDate} but is still Active</value></values>
    <values><field>DescriptionTemplate__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Contracts past EndDate should be renewed or set to Expired.</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordIdField__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Id</value></values>
    <values><field>PrimaryRecordType__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Contract</value></values>
    <values><field>EntitledUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>RealizedUsdField__c</field><value xsi:nil="true"/></values>
    <values><field>IsActive__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:boolean">true</value></values>
    <values><field>Version__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">1</value></values>
    <values><field>Effort__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">low</value></values>
    <values><field>RecoverabilityScore__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:double">1.0</value></values>
    <values><field>Severity__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Info</value></values>
    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Contract records in Activated or Active status whose EndDate is in the past.
Why it matters: Expired contracts still flagged active mean revenue keeps recognizing against a contract that&apos;s legally over. Customer is out-of-contract; legal exposure plus revenue misstatement.
Suppress a finding: when a renewal is mid-flight and the gap is documented.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
</CustomMetadata>
